      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. To be more specific, when you say the opposition is worried about 'election integrity,' is that a substantive concern tied to actual security loopholes, or is it more of a rhetorical tactic to justify restricting access? I'm trying to figure out if there's a real legal basis to their arguments or if they're just trying to stall the rollout.",
